{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Story</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac.png?t=1742984213\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/800.gif?t=1742984213\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a model prisoner taking care of 'security risks' in hell. Your daily routine is simple. Guide a new prisoner, and take them into a cell. While living that boring life, you finally make a decision. To escape to purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But you step into a forbidden room by mistake.\u00a0</strong>In that room, the most dangerous prisoners, called the 'Flowers', are incarcerated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now choose. Either take their hand and escape to purgatory, or close the door as if nothing has ever happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\ud2b9\uc9d5.png?t=1742984213\" /><strong>Game features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Search: Look for clues in a cell reenacting each character's most painful times. Peek into their past, and maybe you can find a hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Conversation and choices: You can talk to characters, listen to their stories and grant their requests, or refuse with cruelty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple Endings: There are five different endings. Choose a character, and face the destiny together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\uc2dc\ud000\uc2a4_124.gif?t=1742984213\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two flowers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have two flowers. Eunyeong Heo and Mabel, the bush clover and the apricot. Will you choose one of them? You could choose both, or none. The outcome is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will see you at the purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540550?t=1742984213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/ff970f582987bccfd3ebd36eca1ff9661d97863e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742984213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/fa6c9d13337b90aa62441f75e3d59a0379e9bd81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742984213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/fa6c9d13337b90aa62441f75e3d59a0379e9bd81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742984213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"There's a corpse, a severed arm, a heart, a large amount of blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Story</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\uc2a4\ud1a0\ub9ac.png?t=1742984213\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/800.gif?t=1742984213\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a model prisoner taking care of 'security risks' in hell. Your daily routine is simple. Guide a new prisoner, and take them into a cell. While living that boring life, you finally make a decision. To escape to purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But you step into a forbidden room by mistake.\u00a0</strong>In that room, the most dangerous prisoners, called the 'Flowers', are incarcerated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now choose. Either take their hand and escape to purgatory, or close the door as if nothing has ever happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\ud2b9\uc9d5.png?t=1742984213\" /><strong>Game features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Search: Look for clues in a cell reenacting each character's most painful times. Peek into their past, and maybe you can find a hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Conversation and choices: You can talk to characters, listen to their stories and grant their requests, or refuse with cruelty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple Endings: There are five different endings. Choose a character, and face the destiny together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/\uc2dc\ud000\uc2a4_124.gif?t=1742984213\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two flowers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have two flowers. Eunyeong Heo and Mabel, the bush clover and the apricot. Will you choose one of them? You could choose both, or none. The outcome is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will see you at the purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["vivid selfish"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/header.jpg?t=1742984213","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257117667,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117667/movie480.mp4